<title>USA: Staples, Office Depot adjourn holder meetings.</title>
<headline>Staples, Office Depot adjourn holder meetings.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBOROUGH, Mass. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Staples Inc and Office Depot Inc said Friday that, in view of pending litigation with the U.S. Federal Trade Commission, they intend to adjourn their Special Shareholder Meetings scheduled to be held on April 28, 1997 until May 28, 1997.</p>
<p>In early April, federal regulators moved to block the proposed merger of the two office superstore chains.</p>
</text>
